<title>POLAND: PBR Q1 net falls to PLN 8.1 mln.</title>
<headline>PBR Q1 net falls to PLN 8.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PBR preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			14.25  vs   15.16</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  14.25  vs   15.18</p>
<p>    net profit				 8.12  vs    8.75</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.00  vs    0.03</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues     51.59  vs   49.13</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  37.33  vs   31.38</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	     8.07  vs    3.23</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    0.21  vs    0.88</p>
<p>    income tax				 6.13  vs    6.43</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs    0.02</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
